* CABSRT18 - BILL PROOF SORT FOR THE OUT OF BALANCE LISTING
* MVT OS/360 SORT/MERGE FORM OF JCL/CTLCARDS/CABSRT18.
* SELECTS THE ACCOUNT LEVEL PROOF RECORDS THAT DID NOT BALANCE
* AND SORTS THEM BY THE SIZE OF THE DIFFERENCE, LARGEST FIRST,
* SO THAT THE CONTROL TEAM WORK THE BIGGEST ONE FIRST.  THE
* DESCENDING KEY ON THE PACKED DIFFERENCE AT 66 IS WHAT PUTS
* THEM IN THAT ORDER AND IS THE WHOLE REASON THE STEP EXISTS.
*
* THE RULE THAT LEFT THIS CARD
*   THE INCLUDE CONDITION ON THE RESULT TEXT AT 74 IS NOT CODED
*   HERE.  THIS SORT HAS NO INCLUDE STATEMENT.  THE E15 EXIT
*   CABSXOOB NOW KEEPS ONLY THE RECORDS WHOSE RESULT TEXT READS
*   OUT OF BAL FOLLOWED BY ONE SPACE, AND BANDS WHAT IT KEEPS BY
*   THE SIZE OF THE DIFFERENCE FOR ITS SYSOUT TALLY.
*   THE TEST IS ON THE RESULT TEXT WRITTEN BY CABBIL11 RATHER
*   THAN ON THE DIFFERENCE FIELD.  A RECORD WHOSE DIFFERENCE IS
*   INSIDE THE PROGRAM TOLERANCE CARRIES THE TEXT IN BALANCE AND
*   IS NOT SELECTED, WHATEVER THE DIFFERENCE FIELD ACTUALLY
*   SAYS.
*
* OPTION EQUALS IS NOT CODED - THIS SORT HAS NO OPTION
* STATEMENT.  TWO ACCOUNTS WITH THE SAME DIFFERENCE PRINT IN
* WHATEVER ORDER THE MERGE LEAVES THEM IN, AND THE LISTING IS
* WORKED FROM THE TOP SO THAT DOES NOT AFFECT THE WORK QUEUE.
*
* WHICH PROOF RECORDS ARE SELECTED IS NO LONGER READABLE FROM
* THIS CONTROL CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(66,8,PD,D)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(120)
 MODS E15=(CABSXOOB,4096,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
